# Week 5 task runner

- Work only under `week5/`.
- Starter frontend is static `index.html` + `app.js` (not React) unless Task 1 is explicitly chosen.
- Collection list endpoints return `{ items, total, page, page_size }`; clamp `page_size` at 100.
- Register `/notes/search` before `/notes/{note_id}`.
- Notes need `created_at` for `sort=created_desc`; migrate existing SQLite with ALTER if needed.
- Search: case-insensitive match on title AND content; sorts `created_desc` | `title_asc`.
- Difficulty reference: Task 8 = easy (list pagination); Task 2 = medium (search + sort + pagination).
- Run `make test` from `week5/` with conda env `cs146s` before claiming done.